/1465" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-Brew&lt;/a&gt; 等。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/Huh55vv0z3BeRGjoUvn6i00EUpBQl1k_BnQXA0Rs8macWVBOVcPbefM36aXFdgiRk8M2uI6AiYI3onDPgJAiZJ-BKtThy8Rm8JCME3XNWg73eslmCRjQ87AqNnG-JNuSpwcpa0fK3VZo8svrgq3KE3720hP9jTHgy5Hf93xg1OecnXy1_T1FJCksRoEVZ4KfHD5W_MF7ZAQrWEPCb5WuR0PFRXHVUr_FY1RqJaJLzNIYB_AnZ_Nhy1rhfm7Yvlc69_QgNWat2HCPj5IC9U_E-GDC_LQSFKWpJedd7BiX7_r__kHC1lhRh9ixSkuxo89d2LdLnaud8gV9p0XXKQJfug.jpg" width="800" height="282" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1525</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1525</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 10:01:37 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MrRSS: 一个 AI 加持下的多平台 #开源 RSS 阅读器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MrRSS: 一个 AI 加持下的多平台 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1524?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#开源&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; RSS 阅读器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢&lt;a href="https://t.me/allaboutrss/23497" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;群友投稿&lt;/a&gt;，介绍了一款目前在 GitHub 上 1K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt; 的 RSS 阅读器软件：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://mrrss.ch3nyang.top/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://mrrss.ch3nyang.top/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repo：&lt;a href="https://github.com/WCY-dt/MrRSS" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/WCY-dt/MrRSS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;「小众软件」的介绍：&lt;a href="https://www.appinn.com/mrrss/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.appinn.com/mrrss/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/bCbD-Y55HJ65PLshJV-Tf6v66sY0hEF3n-cbGawIjhAdIj7m_fBV0neeUN8lrDFCaSuH-Lqhud_6gcWQgKogqmT-_Sq7ZqIIPVjK9AMZwjMiGY7a2RceiopEhZ8lJ_GNOxZEEa2kq1dmaz047vHFRpmTimeDj29476Cy3NVhnMcu7xSIKCCaJet7_-xPG7wsMwEcs9TVJ1k83vp_WUu9qz0yO5hwDN1Gmez28ZDRYDbhGkug9NBRw4RUQuvq958lmRSHF8xBOT1c5qlsjs_A49_NB8_44BDlQbkt3wZU3E9a3O-X